+      <description>The original 40,000,000 $GFOF Lock 3 reached its full cliff on 2026-08-18 05:00 UTC and Streamflow auto-claimed the allocation to the disclosed recipient wallet. On 2026-08-28 the same wallet created a new Streamflow contract with a 40,000,000 $GFOF net scheduled deposit and a new full cliff of 2028-08-18 05:00 UTC. Active contract: 6VjeLZ27NKpTs7n2rVj5pXPQaUrRFFjdk7AV2FwbzojS. Expired predecessor: 7HKRtFyeFAmxuSzXrZ8rayDYGBwSJZMgrn8Xna6hqg7k. Re-lock transaction: 5zr6i6atKvtHi6dPQqTo9du8dBcoHNfqSSU3nubGoQF8PTh876Q8yS5hr9cxjiUDtGxoxU2qUyA8ACCU5nKwjqXD. The active scheduled total remains 130,000,000 $GFOF (13%) across four active contracts. Commitment #002 is marked KEPT; the ten-day interval between maturity and re-lock is stated rather than hidden.</description>
