     <h3>Unlocked Federation tokens do not go to the open market</h3>
     <div class="meta">
       <span>Made 2026-04</span>
-      <span>First test: first unlock event</span>
+      <span>First test resolved: 2026-08-28</span>
     </div>
     <div class="body">
       <p>When the first Streamflow unlock event occurs, the released tokens will not be sold into the market. They will either be re-locked, rotated into operational treasury (visible on-chain), or used per a specific, pre-announced purpose. This will be verifiable on-chain both before and after the event.</p>
-      <p><strong>Status:</strong> Commitment standing. Will be tested at the next unlock — see countdown on /treasury. If we break this, it will appear as <strong>MISSED</strong> on this page before any other coverage.</p>
+      <p><strong>Status update &mdash; KEPT 2026-08-28:</strong> the first 40M lock matured on 2026-08-18 and the full scheduled allocation was re-locked through 2028-08-18. The predecessor, new contract, auto-claim transaction, and re-lock transaction are preserved in <a href="#c033" style="color:var(--cyan);text-decoration:underline">entry #033</a>.</p>
